wer: 25% of 60 = 15."}}, {"at_ms": 6600, "do": "emphasize", "target": "div", "dur_ms": 1000}, {"at_ms": 7600, "do": "caption", "text": "Split the whole into four equal parts"}]}, {"id": "s4", "caption": "The takeaway", "duration_ms": 6000, "narration": "Percent means per hundred. To find a percent of a quantity, turn the percent into a fraction of that new whole, then divide.", "steps": [{"at_ms": 0, "do": "show", "shape": {"id": "mingrid", "kind": "rect", "fill": "#ffffff", "stroke": "#1a1a1a", "strokeWidth": 2, "x": 120, "y": 150, "w": 100, "h": 100, "explain": "The mini hundred-grid: a reminder that percent means per hundred."}}, {"at_ms": 300, "do": "show", "shape": {"id": "dot2", "kind": "circle", "fill": "#e05561", "cx": 130, "cy": 160, "r": 8, "explain": "The marker dot: it points at the shaded quarter."}}, {"at_ms": 400, "do": "move", "target": "dot2", "to": {"cx": 220, "cy": 160}, "dur_ms": 800}, {"at_ms": 1250, "do": "show", "shape": {"id": "mingfill", "kind": "rect", "fill": "#7fb3e8", "stroke": "#1a1a1a", "strokeWidth": 2, "x": 120, "y": 150, "w": 50, "h": 50, "explain": "The shaded cells: 25 out of 100."}}, {"at_ms": 1500, "do": "hide", "target": "dot2"}, {"at_ms": 1600, "do": "show", "shape": {"id": "t1", "kind": "text", "size": 28, "text": "25% = 25/100 = 1/4", "x": 250, "y": 200, "explain": "The conversion: 25% = 25/100 = 1/4."}}, {"at_ms": 2000, "do": "show", "shape": {"id": "bar2", "kind": "rect", "fill": "#ffffff", "stroke": "#1a1a1a", "strokeWidth": 2, "x": 120, "y": 300, "w": 220, "h": 40, "explain": "The 60 bar: the whole again."}}, {"at_ms": 2300, "do": "show", "shape": {"id": "cut", "kind": "line", "stroke": "#1a1a1a", "width": 3, "x1": 175, "y1": 270, "x2": 175, "y2": 285, "explain": "The cut: one quarter of the bar."}}, {"at_ms": 2400, "do": "move", "target": "cut", "to": {"x1": 175, "y1": 300, "x2": 175, "y2": 340}, "dur_ms": 350}, {"at_ms": 2900, "do": "show", "shape": {"id": "qfill2", "kind": "rect", "fill": "#7fb3e8", "stroke": "#1a1a1a